/**
 * Writes real translations over locale values that are not in the locale's own language.
 *
 * A key is only touched when its EFFECTIVE value (common.json deep-merged with extras.json, same
 * order as src/i18n/resources.ts) is missing, still English, French leaked into a non-French
 * locale, or an Arabic/Chinese string with Latin words left inside. Genuine translations are never
 * overwritten.
 *
 * Translations are keyed by the English source string, so one entry covers every key that
 * shares that string. KEY_TRANSLATIONS handles the few context-specific cases.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   node scripts/translate-alert-i18n-keys.mjs --dry-run
 *   node scripts/translate-alert-i18n-keys.mjs
 */
